Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.01,0:01:31.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,When I was thrown into the stormy sea, \NI had nothing to cling to, not even a piece of wood.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.53,0:01:33.55,Narrator,,0,0,0,,"I'm done for!"
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.27,Narrator,,0,0,0,,How often have I thought just that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.27,0:01:39.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But I realized there was one thing I could cling to:
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.19,0:01:43.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.48,0:01:46.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,That's right, no matter what happens,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.33,0:01:49.65,Narrator,,0,0,0,,I must not give up. I must not let go of hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.09,0:01:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.09,0:02:01.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!{false i-frame}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.35,0:02:04.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Hold on to hope and keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.63,0:02:05.92,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.44,0:02:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You little bum!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.31,0:02:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sneak in here again,\NI'll make sure you regret it! Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.93,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.97,0:02:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.42,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't give up."
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.80,0:02:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hold on to hope."
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.95,0:02:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good ever comes my way.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.22,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do! \NYou're too absent-minded.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Was that you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were careless. {/in danger}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.91,0:05:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.56,0:05:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.39,0:05:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really pissing me off!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.31,0:05:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I saved your life \Nat a most dangerous moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.44,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any difference to me. {/I don't care if I died}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No difference?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything good going for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.21,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's always hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.86,0:05:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.44,0:05:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody says that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.71,0:05:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no such thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.23,0:05:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thrown out with the rest of the trash, {I was dumped into this garbage can,}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.43,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't lost hope yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.96,0:06:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out, you little bum!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told you time and time again!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.95,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sneak in again, I'll give you a beating!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.60,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away, and don't come back!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.67,0:06:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're homeless too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.70,0:06:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be surprised. I can tell.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, where should I go next?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.09,0:06:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Now that's the spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.35,0:06:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Won't you come with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you to a nice place.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.71,0:06:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there such a place?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.33,0:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, follow me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.95,0:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.56,0:07:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring... Wind me up!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.43,0:07:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.41,0:07:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a Colonel!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. And who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.42,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ted.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.66,0:07:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.27,0:07:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.26,0:07:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.82,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stray Dog Mack, sir.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.01,0:07:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.18,0:07:42.53,Song,,0,0,0,,A-A-Amusement park {the og translation is solid enough and the lyrics are simple enough that I didn't bother searching the lyrics for songs from here}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.06,0:07:48.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Joyful, joyful amusement park!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.69,0:07:55.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Where all your dreams may come true {Many dreams come true in this place}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.58,0:08:01.32,Song,,0,0,0,,Where? Where? Right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.84,0:08:06.06,Song,,0,0,0,,A-A-Amusement park
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.46,0:08:12.17,Song,,0,0,0,,Joyful, joyful amusement park!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.73,0:08:34.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Swinging to and fro, sliding on the slide
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.67,0:08:40.70,Song,,0,0,0,,Friends in a fairytale world
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.70,0:08:47.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Are playing, look there!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.04,0:08:52.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Where? Where? Right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.36,0:09:17.06,Song,,0,0,0,,The carousel spins around
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.06,0:09:21.33,Song,,0,0,0,,It doesn't speak, but it knows
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.33,0:09:25.33,Song,,0,0,0,,What lonely children hope for
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.33,0:09:29.05,Song,,0,0,0,,Where? Where? Right there
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.05,0:09:31.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Look, right there
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.32,Song,,0,0,0,,Look, right there
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't really moving. How disappointing.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.67,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we just have to turn on the power!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.92,0:10:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.71,0:10:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay! {I protest}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye! {I support}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.01,0:10:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.08,0:10:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the space hall.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.38,0:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.14,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.96,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible to turn on the power at this time of night. \NChildren these days are impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.61,0:10:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.35,0:10:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn on the lights!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The light!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, turn on the lights!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.41,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And be quick about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a majority decision!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.11,0:10:50.66,Overlap,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him! {yoshi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that weird little thing? Halt! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.16,0:10:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{matte matte}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Company halt!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.63,0:11:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,About face!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.97,0:11:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Double quick march!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.75,0:11:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.85,0:11:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.14,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemies incoming! {The enemy's coming!}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.00,0:11:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.70,0:11:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.68,0:11:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's split up! We'll get them!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.35,0:11:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.77,0:11:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they go? We'll get 'em.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.51,0:11:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.72,0:12:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{?}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.47,0:12:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.15,0:12:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.30,0:12:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we got ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.57,0:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing stars...{My head's spinning...}{??? something about the eyes}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Good! Show 'em!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.24,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us! {mou yamete}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.39,0:13:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.02,0:14:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we, Colonel?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.37,0:14:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.13,0:14:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{oh}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.66,0:14:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what I found! Come here!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.62,0:15:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.17,0:15:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost! {/phantom}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.39,0:15:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... It's just a house.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.10,0:15:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go in!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.01,0:15:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.96,0:15:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait up!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.22,0:15:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Those kids are fearless!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Kuro? {kuro = black}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gulliver!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.93,0:15:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know who I am?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.21,0:15:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I didn't think you'd be an old man.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone gets old sooner or later.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.17,0:16:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we've...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallen!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.47,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallen?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.64,0:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we thought we could find\Na nice place to play in the amusement park.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were discovered, \Nand we escaped on a rocket.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.28,0:16:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,On a rocket?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.60,0:16:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very amusing.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not amusing at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.87,0:16:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... I've got something to show you. {I'll show you something now.}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.21,0:16:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.23,0:16:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Now look into it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.04,0:16:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.95,0:16:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, raise the magnification to 50 million times.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.39,0:16:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you see it now?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.14,0:17:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it the Green Planet of Hope. {lit: blue star of hope - the complication is that in japanese, the words for star/planet and green/blue are the same, but we see it appear green, and it's clearly not a star}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.74,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green Planet of Hope?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.91,0:17:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my youthful days, I've travelled \N to many interesting places. For instance...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.57,0:17:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,to a country of little people... {lit: small people}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and a land of giants.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.11,0:17:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So for my last trip,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.88,0:17:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I had planned to go to that far-off place way out in space.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.21,0:17:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? I call it the {\i1}Gulliver{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.17,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Professor. Take me with you. {hakase - just a respectful title for someone knowledgeable}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.11,0:17:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.90,0:17:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It took me too long to build it. {[and I've aged in the meantime]}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.61,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can go to space anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Professor!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you any way I can!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.83,0:18:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.26,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! We cannot! Absolutely cannot!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.47,0:18:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.43,0:18:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This might just turn out to be \Nthe absolute worst trip ever.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.52,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.31,0:18:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it! Don't do it! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.96,0:18:18.99,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.58,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't guarantee that we can ever\N come back from that planet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But... there's always hope!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.70,0:18:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That word brings back memories.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.67,0:18:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.92,0:18:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.85,0:18:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.65,0:18:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{tadadada}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.44,Song,,0,0,0,,Training, training, training!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.44,0:19:03.36,Song,,0,0,0,,Training, training, it's difficult!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.36,0:19:06.07,Song,,0,0,0,,Training, training, even though it's hard
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.07,0:19:10.33,Song,,0,0,0,,We must do our training!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.63,0:20:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The spaceship {\i1}Gulliver{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.47,0:21:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,will now be leaving\Nfor the Green Planet of Hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.60,0:21:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be danger, hardship, and terror awaiting us.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.05,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we must never lose hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.84,0:21:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's accomplish our glorious travel adventure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.76,0:21:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my brave fellows, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.60,0:21:56.23,Song,,0,0,0,,Clouds fly in the blue sky
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.23,0:22:03.05,Song,,0,0,0,,Beyond them is the vast universe
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.05,0:22:09.48,Song,,0,0,0,,Dreams, hopes, and aspirations are there too
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.48,0:22:15.73,Song,,0,0,0,,The stars are calling us
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.73,0:22:22.91,Song,,0,0,0,,Go forth, rocket{\fscx150} {\fscx\fax-0.2}Gulliver{\fax0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.91,0:22:29.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Go forth, our{\fscx150} {\fscx\fax-0.2}Gulliver{\fax0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.91,0:22:49.51,Song,,0,0,0,,We wave goodbye to the blue Earth {again, aoi can be both blue/green, but earth is predominantly blue so going with that this time}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.51,0:22:56.13,Song,,0,0,0,,And advance into the vast universe
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.13,0:23:02.79,Song,,0,0,0,,Our breast pockets are small
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.79,0:23:08.85,Song,,0,0,0,,But full to the brim with hope
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.85,0:23:16.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Go forth, rocket{\fscx150} {\fscx\fax-0.2}Gulliver{\fax0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.04,0:23:22.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Go forth, our{\fscx150} {\fscx\fax-0.2}Gulliver{\fax0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.66,0:23:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! {??? yume help, ikimasu?}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.00,0:23:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.98,0:23:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.48,0:23:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How odd.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to sit like this, upside down.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.36,0:24:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.42,0:24:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I really don't wanna sit like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.34,0:24:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, get the automatic launcher ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.30,0:24:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:33.10,0:24:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,30 seconds to take-off.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.01,0:24:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence countdown!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.76,0:24:53.76,Top,,0,0,0,,10,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:53.76,0:24:54.76,Top,,0,0,0,,9,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.76,0:24:55.76,Top,,0,0,0,,8,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.76,0:24:56.76,Top,,0,0,0,,7,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:57.12,0:24:57.76,Top,,0,0,0,,6,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.10,0:24:58.76,Top,,0,0,0,,5,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.12,0:24:59.76,Top,,0,0,0,,4,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.13,0:25:00.77,Top,,0,0,0,,3,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.24,0:25:01.77,Top,,0,0,0,,2,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.19,0:25:02.77,Top,,0,0,0,,1,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:03.17,0:25:03.73,Top,,0,0,0,,0!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.78,0:26:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, unbuckle your seat belts.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:06.03,0:26:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget your space shoes. {?? makes more sense for this to be "space physics", but they do put on shoes later, so probably uchuu boots?}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:07.99,0:26:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:12.84,0:26:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well do it yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.63,0:26:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,These don't match my style! {These don't look cool on me at all!}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.45,0:26:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, check the course!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:21.57,0:26:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:47.56,0:27:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:58.55,0:28:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's with this? {/weird}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.02,0:28:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.42,0:28:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.15,0:28:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how you eat it.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.71,0:28:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Here goes... {/if it came to this}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.37,0:28:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Mind your manners! {/unsightly}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:30.91,0:28:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, get back here!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:36.19,0:28:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:47.91,0:28:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, switch on the TV!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:50.06,0:28:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.16,0:28:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meteorites!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.59,0:29:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Duck and cover, men! {??? kiken = danger? taihi = taking refuge and waiting (for the danger to pass)?}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:21.73,0:29:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:29.52,0:29:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.96,0:29:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Huh? What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:44.13,0:29:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reverse Time Nebula!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.84,0:29:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverse Time Nebula?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:51.82,0:29:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a world where time goes backwards!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.31,0:29:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Stop that! Help me, somebody!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:03.23,0:30:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, full power! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:58.70,0:31:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.08,0:31:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is spaceship {\i1}Gulliver{\i0}. {\i1}Gulliver{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:16.96,0:31:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let us know your name.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:28.28,0:31:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, who could that be?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:31.74,0:31:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite modest, to leave without even telling us their name.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:44.00,0:31:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.32,0:31:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wind me carefully!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:52.69,0:31:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:59.53,0:32:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor! The fuel system is malfunctioning!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:12.13,0:32:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.86,0:32:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mack.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:22.04,0:32:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh gee, I'm scared...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:29.72,0:32:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:55.48,0:32:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Mack is missing.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.59,0:33:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't change it! \NIt was just getting interesting, dammit.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.23,0:33:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mack! What are you doing? Get back! {??? nani wo shiteoru *** dazo}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.67,0:33:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch. I'm being watched?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:50.70,0:34:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:54.16,0:34:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A good place.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.24,0:34:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A good place?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:59.94,0:35:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the Green Planet of Hope?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:01.57,0:35:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a small place.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:04.04,0:35:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:05.98,0:35:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,On this planet, any wish can be granted.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:10.26,0:35:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.29,0:35:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:12.66,0:35:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But only one each.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:15.20,0:35:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get some real delicious food?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:29.94,0:35:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, little soldier{ doll}?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:33.08,0:35:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.40,0:35:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:37.00,0:35:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,would like to become a human!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:14.84,0:36:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Being human can be difficult.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:18.85,0:36:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!\N Hey, Mack, can I have a little something to eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:25.07,0:36:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel, mind your manners. {throwback to 28:13}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:30.46,0:36:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, will you let me return to my old self?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:35.46,0:36:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one wish each. I can't.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:40.85,0:36:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:42.76,0:36:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, will you grant my wish?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:45.68,0:36:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:47.64,0:36:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the Colonel to his old form.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:49.93,0:36:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:51.42,0:36:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:58.34,0:37:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That form really does suit you best, Colonel.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:01.42,0:37:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're such a good boy, \NI'll grant you another wish, as an exception.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:05.51,0:37:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:09.18,0:37:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No wish?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:13.61,0:37:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:14.95,0:37:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:17.56,0:37:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:19.14,0:37:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:20.74,0:37:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.89,0:37:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:44.45,0:37:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:47.67,0:37:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? We're off course.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:50.90,0:37:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust steering. {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:52.58,0:37:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:57.35,0:37:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:58.92,0:38:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's jamming us!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:00.00,0:38:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jamming?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:02.50,0:38:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,From spatial coordinate 0400.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:04.79,0:38:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Put 0400 on the screen!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:20.23,0:38:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.04,0:38:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, they're forcing us to land, aren't they?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:27.16,0:38:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have no way to escape. {We can't escape either.}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:41.40,0:38:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that signal?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:43.18,0:38:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Engage the translation device!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:50.54,0:38:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Space Patrol.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:52.35,0:38:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Space Patrol to the crew of the spaceship.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:55.54,0:38:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out immediately!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:58.88,0:38:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Say nay!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:12.63,0:39:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:33.95,0:39:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Any record of an organic robot? {??? think they mean "are they robots whose function is based on living organisms/animals?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:36.55,0:39:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:38.33,0:39:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Any plant robot? {same with plants/vegetables}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:39.76,0:39:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:41.88,0:39:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:43.05,0:39:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, submit the record and let them out.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:49.68,0:39:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:51.16,0:39:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:53.10,0:39:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:54.56,0:39:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:55.90,0:39:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:02.43,0:40:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they be?!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:06.35,0:40:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely outrageous!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:08.19,0:40:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:13.60,0:40:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess is returning home.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:25.28,0:40:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's the spaceship we saw earlier!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:40.17,0:40:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:41.48,0:40:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:42.15,0:40:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:42.78,0:40:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...finished...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:43.50,0:40:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...the examination...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:44.20,0:40:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...of the robots.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:47.63,0:40:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You lot are crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:51.35,0:40:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:57.13,0:40:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from Earth, in the Solar System.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:00.49,0:41:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:02.84,0:41:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that saved us earlier, aren't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:08.11,0:41:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I just happened to be passing by.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.62,0:41:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you tell us your name? {left without talking}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:12.90,0:41:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so unfriendly!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:14.56,0:41:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:20.28,0:41:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, your men brought us here by force.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:24.59,0:41:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They tested to see if we were robots and whatnot.\NPerfectly outrageous! {??? nantoka, *** tokoro da}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:28.67,0:41:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:30.34,0:41:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,As a token of my apology, \NI'd like to invite you to dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.49,0:41:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to live on that Green Planet nearby.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:54.31,0:42:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But the robots that our ancestors built went rogue, \Nso we could no longer coexist with them.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:01.59,0:42:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We escaped to this planet.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:04.63,0:42:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But lately, the robots have been coming \Nall the way here to harass us.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.54,0:42:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We spend every day\Nlooking for a new planet to live on.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:52.23,0:42:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:10.37,0:43:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How curious!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:22.85,0:43:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:28.49,0:43:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:38.75,0:43:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please help yourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:58.67,0:44:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but do you always eat this way?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:02.75,0:44:04.32,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hey! Mack! {probs just shh}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:06.82,0:44:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:10.88,0:44:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do they eat on Earth?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.99,0:44:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.12,0:44:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,where do I start...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:16.59,0:44:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pork cutlets, ramen...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:19.60,0:44:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:21.19,0:44:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,curry rice.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:23.11,0:44:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And pig bones!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:25.54,0:44:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Pork saute, beef slice, macaroni, \Nham and eggs, and hamburgers.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.59,0:44:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and also... pickled onion! {pickled Chinese onion}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:34.09,0:44:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell us more...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:35.69,0:44:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...about things you have on Earth.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:38.80,0:44:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the Earth...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:42.39,0:44:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:45.88,0:44:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me explain.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:54.03,0:44:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Earth. {/what earth is like...}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:05.92,0:45:07.61,Song,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 10,0:45:09.12,0:45:10.83,Song,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 10,0:45:12.64,0:45:17.25,Song,,0,0,0,,The words of Earth are, "One, two, three"
Dialogue: 10,0:45:18.77,0:45:24.07,Song,,0,0,0,,You can count anything, "One, two, three"
Dialogue: 10,0:45:25.36,0:45:30.69,Song,,0,0,0,,There are 24 hours in a day
Dialogue: 10,0:45:31.72,0:45:35.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Six days later, it's Sunday
Dialogue: 10,0:45:35.21,0:45:38.33,Song,,0,0,0,,365 days in a year
Dialogue: 10,0:45:45.43,0:45:50.69,Song,,0,0,0,,The ice melts, spring has come
Dialogue: 10,0:45:51.74,0:45:57.48,Song,,0,0,0,,The petals spin from village to town
Dialogue: 10,0:45:58.23,0:46:04.02,Song,,0,0,0,,The sunlight shines between the branches
Dialogue: 10,0:46:04.68,0:46:07.61,Song,,0,0,0,,Look, it's pouring through!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:10.06,0:46:11.75,Song,,0,0,0,,However... {\alpha&HFF&}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.75,0:46:13.01,Song,,0,0,0,,However... However...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:16.43,0:46:25.17,Song,,0,0,0,,The pot is too small, how lonely {???}{wiki: the second part explains the four seasons of the Earth, and includes lyrics that reflect the era, such as "overcrowded housing," "nuclear weapons," "automobile noise pollution," and "poverty in depopulated areas."}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:27.96,0:46:33.55,Song,,0,0,0,,In the southern seas, summer has come
Dialogue: 10,0:46:34.32,0:46:40.03,Song,,0,0,0,,According to a legend among the fish
Dialogue: 10,0:46:40.64,0:46:46.55,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a coral island
Dialogue: 10,0:46:47.16,0:46:50.20,Song,,0,0,0,,Look, it's shining!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:55.58,0:46:57.46,Song,,0,0,0,,However... {\alpha&HFF&}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:57.46,0:46:59.04,Song,,0,0,0,,However... However...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:01.76,0:47:10.11,Song,,0,0,0,,There's a frightful bomb, poor things {possibly a reflection upon https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daigo_Fukury%C5%AB_Maru }
Dialogue: 10,0:47:15.46,0:47:20.56,Song,,0,0,0,,Leaves are falling, autumn has come
Dialogue: 10,0:47:21.55,0:47:27.23,Song,,0,0,0,,Friends are there on a street corner
Dialogue: 10,0:47:28.15,0:47:34.41,Song,,0,0,0,,Singing a chanson quietly {french for "song", w/e that means in JP, probably just because this story in the song (what we see now) happens in france}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:34.41,0:47:37.19,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, it brings back memories!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:42.30,0:47:44.17,Song,,0,0,0,,However... {\alpha&HFF&}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:44.17,0:47:45.70,Song,,0,0,0,,However... However...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:49.04,0:47:57.72,Song,,0,0,0,,The noises of the town are too loud, how sad
Dialogue: 10,0:48:04.32,0:48:09.69,Song,,0,0,0,,Powdery snow whirls, winter has come
Dialogue: 10,0:48:10.68,0:48:16.43,Song,,0,0,0,,The village is lit up with small bonfires {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:17.14,0:48:22.87,Song,,0,0,0,,The children's cheeks are flushed
Dialogue: 10,0:48:23.63,0:48:27.37,Song,,0,0,0,,Look, they're playing!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:28.95,0:48:30.85,Song,,0,0,0,,However... {\alpha&HFF}However...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:30.85,0:48:32.59,Song,,0,0,0,,However... However...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:34.94,0:48:43.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Their clothes are torn, poor things
Dialogue: 10,0:48:52.65,0:48:53.41,Song,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 10,0:48:55.56,0:48:57.24,Song,,0,0,0,,One, two, three
Dialogue: 10,0:48:58.87,0:49:02.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Do, re, mi, fa, so, la, ti, do
Dialogue: 10,0:49:02.08,0:49:04.46,Song,,0,0,0,,This is the counting song of Earth!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:10.26,0:49:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth sounds so interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:12.74,0:49:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not interesting at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:17.71,0:49:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:20.76,0:49:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds so much better than here.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:26.99,0:49:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For our nation, science has made too much progress, \Nand it has spelled disaster for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:44.83,0:49:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:46.07,0:49:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh no, excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:56.35,0:49:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, what's happening here?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:59.35,0:50:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:00.52,0:50:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:01.77,0:50:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:02.97,0:50:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what exactly is going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:09.89,0:50:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:12.10,0:50:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was alpha-ten-thousand squared QPR years ago. {just meant to be meaningless technobabble kyupioru - combination of letters from their made-up alphabet, but for some reason alpha wasn't changed}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:19.32,0:50:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:20.50,0:50:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was alpha-ten-thousand {\i1}cubed{\i0} QPR years ago. {same line but the degree of kyupioru changed from 2 to 3}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:24.90,0:50:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NIt was cubed PR alpha!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:28.91,0:50:34.84,Song,,0,0,0,,Well, Pior, Teta, Operon, equals plus minus infinity
Dialogue: 10,0:50:35.70,0:50:38.96,Song,,0,0,0,,No, it's the square root of gamma denominator
Dialogue: 10,0:50:40.00,0:50:43.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Or was it Gijo squared times 15? {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:50:45.92,0:50:53.57,Song,,0,0,0,,Although we forgot it somehow, we lived on the Green Planet once
Dialogue: 10,0:50:57.23,0:51:01.62,Song,,0,0,0,,The ancestral scientists thought about it
Dialogue: 10,0:51:01.62,0:51:04.87,Song,,0,0,0,,Racked their brains thinking about it {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:04.87,0:51:08.47,Song,,0,0,0,,Day after day, they thought about...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:08.47,0:51:12.20,Song,,0,0,0,,A robot that could do everything
Dialogue: 10,0:51:12.20,0:51:17.55,Song,,0,0,0,,We can do it! We can make that robot!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:21.54,0:51:24.97,Song,,0,0,0,,Life would be easier with that robot
Dialogue: 10,0:51:25.30,0:51:28.89,Song,,0,0,0,,Life would be carefree with that robot
Dialogue: 10,0:52:12.18,0:52:17.71,Song,,0,0,0,,The easy life is here
Dialogue: 10,0:52:17.71,0:52:23.18,Song,,0,0,0,,Almighty science is paradise
Dialogue: 10,0:52:23.18,0:52:28.37,Song,,0,0,0,,The Green Planet is paradise
Dialogue: 10,0:52:40.82,0:52:49.77,Song,,0,0,0,,Go to Hell! Go to Hell!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:49.77,0:52:53.64,Song,,0,0,0,,Go to Hell, humans!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:54.51,0:52:58.78,Song,,0,0,0,,The humans are spineless {????? nc what's that koshigoyoshi, og subs had "suckers"}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:58.78,0:53:02.03,Song,,0,0,0,,And lazy {???????? the song is by ダニー飯田とパラダイス・キング - titled ロボットたちの歌 - but naturally, for a 1960 anime-exclusive song, there's no trace of lyrics, and these lines are completely down in the weeds}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:02.03,0:53:11.91,Song,,0,0,0,,They mechanized anything and everything and became so conceited {I may be delusional but that sounds to me like "even this song is machine-written"}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:11.91,0:53:15.30,Song,,0,0,0,,Now rise, robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:16.07,0:53:19.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:22.84,0:53:26.64,Song,,0,0,0,,We are robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:27.08,0:53:32.39,Song,,0,0,0,,Proud robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:40.34,0:53:44.46,Song,,0,0,0,,I am the master of the universe
Dialogue: 10,0:53:44.46,0:53:48.01,Song,,0,0,0,,Now rise, robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:48.88,0:53:52.20,Song,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:53.40,0:53:57.69,Song,,0,0,0,,We are robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:57.69,0:54:02.73,Song,,0,0,0,,Proud robots!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:19.58,0:54:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On that Green Planet of Hope?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:29.42,0:54:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.83,0:54:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not a planet of hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:35.45,0:54:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like a planet of demons.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:38.60,0:54:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This was something I never expected.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:50.39,0:54:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was our own fault for being greedy.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:56.42,0:54:58.06,Top,,0,0,0,,This is the Space Patrol!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:58.06,0:54:59.75,Top,,0,0,0,,Attention! This is the Space Patrol!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:59.75,0:55:04.11,Top,,0,0,0,,A robot-crewed spaceship is approaching!\NA spaceship is approaching! {??}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:07.44,0:55:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:09.16,0:55:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:41.10,0:55:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! King! Please hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:41.49,0:55:46.86,Top,,0,0,0,,Father! Father! Father! Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:43.51,0:55:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Majesty! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:45.35,0:55:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:48.44,0:55:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention! The enemy spaceship is heading northwest!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:48.52,0:56:53.27,Top,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! We can't hold them back any longer!\NThey're nearing the palace! Put the palace on high alert!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:53.27,0:56:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The cannons! Man the cannons!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:16.03,0:57:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:21.35,0:57:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:23.25,0:57:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:25.00,0:57:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire! {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:13.83,0:58:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:17.22,0:58:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:17.88,0:58:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:19.33,0:58:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty, hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:23.68,0:58:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! We all must hide!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:27.97,0:58:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In here! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:31.30,0:58:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{maybe hurry}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:33.95,0:58:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:51.66,0:58:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mack?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:53.66,0:58:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:07.07,0:59:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Not me! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:18.15,0:59:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! The Princess's piece is gone! {lit: princess's horse}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:20.97,0:59:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The Princess?!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:24.70,0:59:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:29.65,0:59:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:39.53,0:59:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:41.97,0:59:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:44.76,0:59:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:14.71,1:00:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:17.28,1:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must go save them!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:19.97,1:00:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... Let's go save them!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:24.52,1:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you save her?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:25.43,1:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I'm afraid that is impossible.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:29.46,1:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:30.82,1:00:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to give up without even trying?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:33.84,1:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't fight robots.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:37.28,1:00:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything but give up.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:41.49,1:00:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:43.29,1:00:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't just let them take away Mack and the Princess!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:47.82,1:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack is one of my best friends.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:51.02,1:00:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess is too.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:59.30,1:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of this planet have forgotten\N what's most important.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:09.04,1:01:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:12.35,1:01:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:13.35,1:01:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:15.40,1:01:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We must never lose hope.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:17.64,1:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:30.54,1:01:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NWe have everything but drinking water.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:34.30,1:01:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking water?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:36.46,1:01:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's H2O.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:39.56,1:01:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,H2O?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:41.01,1:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have any H2O.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:42.90,1:01:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:44.80,1:01:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave it up a long time ago. {???}
Dialogue: 10,1:01:47.96,1:01:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:12.62,1:02:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's water! Water!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:14.12,1:02:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can defeat the robots with this!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:17.67,1:02:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:20.72,1:02:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:24.16,1:02:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, do you?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:26.57,1:02:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm from the Solar System.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:30.64,1:02:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An animal from Earth.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:33.68,1:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a stray dog, from the Canidae family!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:37.04,1:02:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A stray dog?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:38.94,1:02:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a doggie. {wanko = bow-wow​ (Children's language)}
Dialogue: 10,1:02:40.72,1:02:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A doggie?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:44.20,1:02:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:46.82,1:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Recorder robot!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:57.67,1:02:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:12.93,1:03:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no record?!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:20.25,1:03:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a thing to do!\NWhy don't they know what a dog is?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:36.79,1:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's spaceship {\i1}Gulliver{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:39.37,1:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gulliver{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:41.16,1:03:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Investigate it!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:53.03,1:03:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:55.80,1:03:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all robots! Attack that spaceship!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:00.29,1:04:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Repair the scrap robots immediately! {was: Factory robot, begin making more robots!}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:04.60,1:04:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Start moving! {??}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:28.12,1:04:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I must wreck the scrapyard! {was: factory}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:44.09,1:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way to the scrapyard?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:46.23,1:04:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A drop in the morning.\NA drop in the evening.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:49.31,1:04:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Manpuku." Please have a Manpuku. {likely a proper name of a drug, the word itself means a lot of nice things: https://jisho.org/search/manpuku}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:52.78,1:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? It's a commercial robot?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:03.25,1:05:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gun robots!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:15.49,1:06:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Nicely done! {????}
Dialogue: 10,1:06:17.99,1:06:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All robots!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:20.17,1:06:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:48.14,1:06:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted, are you ready?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:49.36,1:06:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're all set.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:52.14,1:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro, go find Mack while they're distracted!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:54.35,1:06:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:48.83,1:07:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Pump more water!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:50.21,1:07:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:42.28,1:09:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Help!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:54.03,1:09:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,1:10:10.84,1:10:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:35.12,1:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now only that boss robot remains.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:07.69,1:11:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:12.03,1:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this really is a problem!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:50.54,1:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No use! Run!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:22.16,1:12:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! {?????}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:33.38,1:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead end!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:36.47,1:12:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Professor!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:22.76,1:13:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:24.17,1:13:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:26.57,1:13:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What robot are you?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:28.62,1:13:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One cup in the morning. \NTwo in the evening.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:32.18,1:13:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mack." Please have a Mack.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:34.51,1:13:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:44.60,1:13:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:06.28,1:14:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:19.03,1:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:32.03,1:14:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Upsy-daisy...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:50.08,1:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:51.38,1:14:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ted!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:01.79,1:15:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:03.72,1:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the princess, Colonel.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:05.56,1:15:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:14.03,1:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:27.78,1:15:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:31.07,1:15:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:40.05,1:15:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor! We couldn't find the princess!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:43.99,1:15:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We destroyed the transistor robots\Nthat were running the boss robot.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:03.40,1:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:24.42,1:16:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:47.39,1:16:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:01.72,1:17:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:02.90,1:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she's not wounded.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:10.56,1:17:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:12.55,1:17:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It might break the princess!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:17.70,1:17:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:22.95,1:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My dress! {wiki: A young Hayao Miyazaki also participated in the production, but Miyazaki, who was merely an animator at the time, was not satisfied with the ending of the film, in which the robots remained inhuman. He proposed the idea that the robots were actually human, which was adopted. [ 5 ] Miyazaki also created the original drawings for the scene in which the girl wakes up . [ 6 ] He also worked on the scenes in which the robots go on a rampage and cause destruction, but later commented with a laugh, "I think it's the worst movie ever made. " [ 7 ] }
Dialogue: 10,1:17:28.83,1:17:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear this for now.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:31.79,1:17:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, stand up.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:36.41,1:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:38.43,1:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:43.30,1:17:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack, the people of the Purple Planet \Nonly appeared to be robots.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:48.68,1:17:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They were no more robots than we are.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:51.25,1:17:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted realized it early on.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:54.67,1:17:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the sun is rising.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:04.97,1:18:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green Planet will be reborn.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:08.58,1:18:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:19.26,1:18:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted, thanks to you, there is hope for this planet.
Dialogue: 10,1:19:05.85,1:19:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,1:19:08.66,1:19:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 10,1:19:16.46,1:19:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Colonel!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:20.66,1:19:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mack!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:29.08,1:19:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 10,1:19:33.31,1:19:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,1:19:38.41,1:19:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack, come on.
Dialogue: 10,1:19:58.52,1:19:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mack!
